msgid ""
"Select a Google Sheets to connect your data. If your sheet is not listed, fetch "
"the latest sheets or create a new one. Then complete the setup and save your "
"changes to start syncing."
msgstr ""
"选择一个 Google 表格以连接您的数据。如果您的表格未列出，请获取最新的表格或创建一个"
"新的。然后完成设置并保存更改以开始同步。"

